Create the quick-entry window lazily on first use instead of at startup.

Creating it eagerly means two renderers boot the SPA simultaneously; with an
expired JWT both spend the same single-use OAuth refresh token and the loser's
401 drops the user to the login screen on every cold start.
See https://github.com/go-vikunja/vikunja/issues/3275

--- a/main.js
+++ b/main.js
@@ -438,7 +438,6 @@
 app.whenReady().then(() => {
 	startServer(() => {
 		createMainWindow()
-		createQuickEntryWindow()
 		setupTray()
 
 		registerQuickEntryShortcut(DEFAULT_QUICK_ENTRY_SHORTCUT)
